-  <jbophrase>gerzda</jbophrase> would win. Its <varname>L</varname> score =
is 6, its <varname>A</varname> score is 0, its <varname>H</varname> score i=
s 0, its <varname>R</varname> score is 12, and its <varname>V</varname> sco=
re is 3, for a final score of 5878. The other forms have scores of 7917, 63=
67, 9506, 8008, and 10047 respectively. Consequently, this lujvo would prob=
ably appear in the dictionary in the form=20
-  <jbophrase>gerzda</jbophrase>.</para>
-  <para>For the next example, we will use the tanru=20
